{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"waystation_night","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":3,"title":"Weight of Pages","title_ko":"페이지의 무게"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_night/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"They ate from their own provisions. Arrel took the floor by the door, his sword across his knees.","text_ko":"둘은 자신들이 가져온 식량을 먹었다. 아렐은 문 옆 바닥에 앉아 무릎 위에 검을 놓았다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_night/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"The night had no insects, no birds, no wind. The silence came not from sleep, but from absence.","text_ko":"밤에는 벌레도 새도 바람도 없었다. 그 침묵은 잠이 아니라 부재에서 왔다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_night/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Past midnight, Elia's fingers curled around the Blank Book. She hummed three quiet notes from a lullaby neither of them could source.","text_ko":"자정이 지난 뒤, 엘리아의 손가락이 백서를 감쌌다. 그녀는 둘 중 누구도 출처를 찾지 못하는 자장가의 세 음을 낮게 흥얼거렸다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_night/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Arrel's hand twitched in answer. His body held something his mind had already dropped.","text_ko":"아렐의 손이 대답하듯 떨렸다. 그의 몸은 정신이 이미 놓쳐 버린 무언가를 붙들고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_night/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_pain"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"...","text_ko":"..."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"b6145d3507bfa670d89de172c62b4f42acfb4c2825511ce8eaec58c9cc3f0eb7","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
